  "source_review": [
    "Only two new composition files; all13 production/test sources exactly equal their immutable prior reviewed revisions",
    "Runner explicitly selects five modules using EUnit inparallel and requires ok; actual53 unique test records observed",
    "Fixed approved168 dependency inventory has unique paths; current source and both staged copies rehashed",
    "Relaxed @ grammar applies only to copied dependency basenames; generic receipt source grammar unchanged",
    "CLI refuses existing target, wrong ambient cwd and altered executed driver before a new output stage is created",
    "Raw-bytecode digest recipe -without-runtime avoids wrapper launch; observed compilation traces contain only21 successful ELF executions"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Independent replay uses parent-compiled artifacts after exact source, dependency and artifact checks; independent fresh staging performed, compile itself not redundantly repeated",
    "Stage target is caller-selected fresh absolute path; it is not an authorization sandbox or hostile-symlink confinement guarantee",
    "Fixed approved dependency inventory and cooperative filesystem are assumptions; asynchronous hostile mutation is outside scope",
    "Reusable ev_receipts.cma and native adapter are existing automation support, hashed here; no complete interpreter/archive/dynamic-library build closure claimed",
    "Trace audit is of supplied actual compile execve records and currently resolved executable bytes, not authenticated author identity or all possible transitive executions",
    "Concurrent tests establish this component composition only: no live music/UI/audio, global suite, full EV101/104/107 proof, admission or release closure"
  ],
